 <COL N="0048B"></COL> <FOREIGN LANG=Greek>thðû didaskalivaû, thún politeivan toiouðton ouøn kaiú nuðn toiðû
ajrcieratikoiðû ejgkaqidruvsate qrovnoiû, oåpwû aÞn kaiú hJmeiðû
